flowchart TB
  accTitle: Inspect and resolve conflicts in Lazygit
  accDescr: Inspect the code in each conflict. Space chooses the current hunk and b keeps both sides. Return to Files, stage with Space, continue the original merge, rebase, or cherry-pick, and validate.
  conflict["1 · A merge produces conflicts<br/>Files lists the conflicted files"]
  open["Enter · Open a conflicted file"]
  choose["2 · Inspect each conflict<br/>Space picks the current hunk"]
  subgraph versions["Available versions"]
    direction LR
    ours["ours<br/>Current version"]
    theirs["theirs<br/>Incoming version"]
    both["Keep both sides<br/>b"]
    ours ~~~ theirs ~~~ both
  end
  resolved["Every conflict block is resolved"]
  stage["3 · Inspect and stage files with Space"]
  commit["Continue and validate<br/>Rebase / cherry-pick: m → continue<br/>Merge: follow the completion prompt"]
  conflict --> open --> choose
  choose --> versions
  versions --> resolved
  resolved --> stage --> commit
